{
  "name": "Model operations workshop",
  "description": "Independently authored gateway setup recipe. This JSON is not a .sparkproj and does not run itself. Use only a disposable gateway; every value and path is synthetic.",
  "walkthrough": [
    "Open Models. The first-use welcome offers Use a starter or Use my data. Choose models and their versions in the toolbar; hide or restore the actionable setup guide as needed.",
    "Import modelRecipe into the combined draft. Define fields exposes basic field settings first; expand Quality rules or Process alarms when needed. Connect machines provides the equipment grid; wide layouts also offer Combined view.",
    "Review and apply once. Needs setup means settings or a relevant draft require attention; Waiting for data means saved equipment has not received all samples. Ready requires Good samples from every enabled field.",
    "Use Check > Live object and Data issues. Follow valueExercises on source memory tags; an invalid Load value produces a Data issue badge. Review data issues opens the affected equipment and keeps its original value visible.",
    "Use Manage > Versions to review WorkshopPress v1 to v2 and explicitly select WorkshopMemoryV2 for Press01 only. Inspect Dependencies before exporting under Share.",
    "Under Share > Publish MQTT, follow Choose equipment, Connect to a broker, Preview the messages, Test the connection and Enable delivery. Keep publishing off during setup; Save and test broker saves disabled settings. Inspect Delivery options only when changing delivery or queue defaults."
  ],
